&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://columbiahealth.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIlcuiuqDgvGNE5qnrO4-1I-EAGEAjTqBb2" target="_blank"&gt;Monday, March 24 at 4&amp;nbsp;PM ET&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
