&lt;p&gt;This workshop is taught by MFA Sound Art graduate student&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;Aacute;sa &amp;Oacute;lafsd&amp;oacute;ttir&lt;/strong&gt;, and is part of the &lt;strong&gt;Music Technology Workshops Series&lt;/strong&gt;, co-sponsored by the Music &amp;amp; Arts Library and the Libraries&amp;#39; Digital Scholarship program. For a list of all the workshops, with registration links, go to:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="http://bit.ly/MusTechSp25" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;bit.ly/MusTechSp25&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
