&lt;p&gt;Spirituality at TC is a student organization of Teachers College. The organization&amp;#39;s mission is to create a nurturing and supportive space where the students and the wider TC/Columbia community can learn about the Spirit-Mind-Body connection and deepen their spiritual paths together. Spirituality at TC is unique as it embodies a holistic approach that combines various ancient spiritual concepts with modern science in education and practice for diverse communities related to mental, physical, and spiritual wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
