&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jianwen Que, MD, PhD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faculty Director of Genetically Modified Mouse Models Shared Resource (GMMMSR)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dept. of Medicine&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Title:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of Genetically Modified Mouse Models Shared Resource (GMMMSR)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Description:&amp;nbsp;Jianwen Que, MD, PhD, Faculty Director of Genetically Modified Mouse Models Shared Resource (GMMMSR) will share an overview of GMMMSR. GMMMSR provides essential services for cancer research including the production of transgenic mice through pronuclear injection, the creation of knockout and knock-in mice via gene targeting in embryonic stem cells, and the development of CRISPR/Cas9-mediated genome editing models. Furthermore, the GMMMSR provides expertise in experimental design, vector construction, and mouse colony management, ensuring researchers have access to state-of-the-art resources for studying gene function and disease mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ken Olive, PhD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Director of Oncology Precision Therapeutics and Imaging Core (OPTIC)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dept. of Medicine&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Title:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of Oncology Precision Therapeutics and Imaging Core (OPTIC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Description:&amp;nbsp;Ken Olive, PhD, Director of Oncology Precision Therapeutics and Imaging Core (OPTIC) Shared Resource (SR) will provide an overview of OPTIC. OPTIC offers researchers access to a broad range of in vivo imaging technologies, including optical, ultrasound, micro-CT, and high-field MRI. OPTIC specializes in generating patient-derived xenograft models across various organ sites, employing orthotopic implantation techniques to create disease-relevant tumor microenvironments. It offers expertise in molecular imaging technologies and supports researchers throughout the lifespan of in vivo studies, from planning and execution to analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
